      "text": "6",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "10",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "16",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$x_{1}+x_{2}+x_{3}+x_{4}=10 \\quad x_{i} \\geq 2$\r\n$\\Rightarrow\\left(x_{1}-2\\right)+\\left(x_{2}-2\\right)+\\left(x_{3}-2\\right)+\\left(x_{4}-2\\right)=2$\r\n$\\begin{array}{llll}\\mathrm{y}_{1} & \\mathrm{y}_{2} & \\mathrm{y}_{3} & \\mathrm{y}_{4}\\end{array}$\r\n$\\mathrm{y}_{1}+\\mathrm{y}_{2}+\\mathrm{y}_{3}+\\mathrm{y}_{4}=2 ; \\mathrm{y}_{i} \\geq 0$\r\n$\\therefore$ N.O.W $={ }^{2+4-1} \\mathrm{C}_{4-1}={ }^{5} \\mathrm{C}_{3}=10$"
  }
